        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository efb0894c-426e-4f66-9822-880d1e735047).Image",
        "Description": "In show business, there will always be people looking to take your place. The management looking to draw evey penny from you at all costs. The engineers here to sabotage your work and destroy your career. The fans who refuse to see you as anything less than deific and will stop at nothing to stand shoulder to shoulder with gods.\r\rAnd then there&apos;s yourself. What are you willing to give. Can you live at ease knowing there are long knives round ever corner.\r\rThe king is dead. Long live the king.",
